                     <explicit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#18r">-18r</locus>وَاَنْ تَجْمَعُوْا بَيْنَ الأُخْتَيْنِ الِّا مَا قَدْ سَلَفَ اِنِّ اللهَ كَاَنَ غَفُوْراً رَحِيْماً<note>ḥarakāt under šadda-s </note>
                     </explicit>
                     <note>3:92-4:23. Title of sura rubricated. Eleven lines a page. Ihmāl marks (rā’-s). Words completed on the following line. Several words left uncompleted on the line, rewritten in full on the following line. Deletions and corrections by the main copyist. In the margin, deletion in red color (15v), and corrections from another hand. Mark of beginning of sura in black ink (14v).</note>
